<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-yr govt bond yield rises to 21.47pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-yr govt bond yield rises to 21.47pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's three-year government bonds was set by auction at 21.47 percent, up from 21.33 percent at an auction on Nov 21, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    BOND OF THE 1999/D SERIES</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    17,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     41,049.49 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   15,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		16,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	  21.47 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		  101.09 pct</p>
</text>
